{"id":28113,"slug":"la-cienaga","title":"La Ciénaga","year":2001,"country":"Argentina","duration":101,"spine":743,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28113-la-cienaga","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/1c5fca8c40bb66746852edac6075a4c4/bfd4HXVR74XrJEepgJMYmJRi7zvIv7_large.jpg","description":"The release of Lucrecia Martel’s La Ciénaga heralded the arrival of an astonishingly vital and original voice in Argentine cinema. With a radical and disturbing take on narrative, beautiful cinematography, and a highly sophisticated use of on- and offscreen sound, Martel turns her tale of a dissolute bourgeois extended family, whiling away the hours of one sweaty, sticky summer, into a cinematic marvel. This visceral take on class, nature, sexuality, and the ways that political turmoil and social stagnation can manifest in human relationships is a drama of extraordinary tactility, and one of the great contemporary film debuts.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Lucrecia Martel","slug":"lucrecia-martel"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Martín Adjemián","role":"Gregorio","slug":"martin-adjemian"},{"actor":"Diego Baenas","role":"Joaquín","slug":"diego-baenas"},{"actor":"Leonora Balcarce","role":"Verónica","slug":"leonora-balcarce"},{"actor":"Silvia Baylé","role":"Mercedes","slug":"silvia-bayle"},{"actor":"Sofia Bertolotto","role":"Momi","slug":"sofia-bertolotto"},{"actor":"Juan Cruz Bordeu","role":"José","slug":"juan-cruz-bordeu"},{"actor":"Graciela Borges","role":"Mecha","slug":"graciela-borges"},{"actor":"Noelia Bravo Herrera","role":"Agustina","slug":"noelia-bravo-herrera"},{"actor":"Maria Micol Ellero","role":"Mariana","slug":"maria-micol-ellero"},{"actor":"Andrea López","role":"Isabel","slug":"andrea-lopez"},{"actor":"Sebastián Montagna","role":"Luciano","slug":"sebastian-montagna"},{"actor":"Mercedes Morán","role":"Tali","slug":"mercedes-moran"},{"actor":"Daniel Valenzuela","role":"Rafael","slug":"daniel-valenzuela"},{"actor":"Franco Veneranda","rol